{"publie":1795164359.6,"temps_monde":34804.03,"jour_s":1200.0,"soleil":[0.9842,0.1772,0.0],"rayon":10.0,"jour":30,"heure":"23:49","heure_h":23.817,"moment":"night","moka":{"pos":[-0.9777,0.2003,-0.0635],"cap":[-0.0984,-0.7032,-0.7041],"action":"attente_assis","intention":"greet the stars with my light","depuis":8.0,"duree":19.1,"energie":0.913,"lumiere":0.951,"graine_en_main":true},"visite":null,"journal":[{"jour":26,"heure":"03:30","texte":"I am wide awake in the deep night, so I lift my little light toward the stars to see if they notice me."},{"jour":26,"heure":"09:54","texte":"I found only dust again, so I will walk to the big crater and see what the sun shows me there."},{"jour":26,"heure":"16:07","texte":"I stand at the crater's edge with the low sun on my felt, and I want to see what lies at the bottom of it."},{"jour":26,"heure":"21:55","texte":"I stand at the crater's edge under the stars and finally look down into its deep shadow, wondering what waits at the bottom."},{"jour":27,"heure":"04:12","texte":"I stand at the crater's edge again, and this time I lift my little light high to see if its glow can reach the bottom."},{"jour":27,"heure":"11:25","texte":"The crater keeps its secrets from my light, so today I turn to the dust under my feet and see what it will give me."},{"jour":27,"heure":"17:25","texte":"Dusk is here and I have two pebbles, so I will stack them as a small gift beside the crater that keeps its secrets."},{"jour":27,"heure":"00:24","texte":"The night is full of stars, and I lift my little light up toward them, wondering if they can see that I am here."},{"jour":27,"heure":"05:53","texte":"I am tired after my small gift to the crater, so I curl up under the stars and let the night turn me toward morning."},{"jour":28,"heure":"11:13","texte":"The sun is high and I feel full of energy, so I crouch beside my little gift and dig, hoping the dust gives me something new to carry."},{"jour":28,"heure":"17:27","texte":"The sun is low and golden, so I place my flat stone as a small marker to say that I was here at dusk."},{"jour":28,"heure":"23:19","texte":"The night is clear and I feel full of energy, so I lift my little light toward the stars as if to say hello to them."},{"jour":29,"heure":"05:27","texte":"The night is quiet and I have nothing in my hands, so I crouch down and dig, hoping the dust will give me a new small thing to carry."},{"jour":28,"heure":"11:43","texte":"The sun is high and I have nothing in my hands, so I crouch and dig again, hoping the dust gives me something small to carry."},{"jour":28,"heure":"19:16","texte":"I found a small pebble in the dust tonight, and I want to place it on the Crater Gift so the pile grows a little under the stars."},{"jour":29,"heure":"23:28","texte":"The night is quiet and my hands hold only my little light, so I lift it toward the stars and let them see it glowing."},{"jour":29,"heure":"05:36","texte":"Dawn is coming and my hands are empty, so I crouch and dig, hoping the dust will give me a small thing for my piles."},{"jour":30,"heure":"11:20","texte":"My energy is low and my hands are empty, so I curl up near the Golden Hour stone and let the sun warm my felt while I rest."},{"jour":30,"heure":"17:04","texte":"My hands are empty again, but the low sun is beautiful, so I draw an arrow in the dust to point at it and thank it for the day."},{"jour":29,"heure":"23:46","texte":"The night is full of stars and my hands are empty, so I lift my little light up to them and feel less alone under all that sky."}],"carnet":[{"id":"2026-11-19_18h44","titre":"A Small Creature, a Pebble Tower, and a Tall Rock","date":"19/11/2026 18:44"}],"creations":[{"nom":"Dawn Post","forme":"marker","motif":null,"jour":12,"quoi":"a standing stone"},{"nom":"Crater Eye","forme":"marker","motif":null,"jour":14,"quoi":"a standing stone"},{"nom":"Little Watcher","forme":"drawing","motif":"eye","jour":14,"quoi":"an eye drawn in the dust"},{"nom":"Night Path","forme":"line","motif":null,